  "body": "Calling all professionals, downsizers, and lock up and leavers!\r\n\r\nDiscover contemporary coastal living at its best with this architecturally designed residence nestled in the heart of Browns Bay. This exceptional penthouse apartment seamlessly blends style and functionality, offering a lifestyle that’s both refined and relaxed just moments from the beach and vibrant village-style amenities.\r\n\r\n• Generous open-plan living with 3-metre high ceilings that frame everyday moments and elevate your sense of space.\r\n• Two well-appointed bedrooms plus a dedicated study area – versatile for work or leisure.\r\n• Luxurious master ensuite for privacy and comfort.\r\n• Designer kitchen with quality appliances including a built-in refrigerator – perfect for food preparation and entertaining.\r\n• Underfloor heating in both bathrooms and ducted air conditioning throughout for year-round comfort.\r\n• Large covered balcony that extends your living space outdoors and invites alfresco dining or relaxation.\r\n• Double garage parking.\r\n\r\nPositioned just a short walk from Browns Bay Beach, cafés, boutique shopping, eateries and everyday conveniences, the location brings the very best of beachside living together in one place. Whether you’re downsizing, seeking a low-maintenance home or simply want to embrace a true coastal lifestyle, this property presents a compelling opportunity.",
